### Inject synthetic tap at x=100 (demo widget esc is widget 0)
NOTE: demo layout uses width=60 (DisplayInfo.width=60) but touch coords
come in x∈[0,2170] (SIM_WIDTH=2170). Recording the coordinate-space
behavior as a FINDING. Injecting at x=30 (within the 0..60 layout space
to test whether hit_test matches in layout space) AND at x=1000 (touch
space, to test the mismatch).
```
injected tap at x=30 into /dev/input/event18
injected tap at x=1000 into /dev/input/event18
```

